From 82c615a8f5b04566fa4dd65cd9b2ccac7a24b735 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lucudar <lucudar@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 00:13:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] v12.4-FULLLOG: sync fsync logging, crash dump, watchdog
 stack, lifecycle trace

- maxlog now does sync open/write/fsync on caller thread (no async loss on crash)
- file truncation keeps last 1500 lines
- crash handler: 96 frames, tid, g_blockRead, fsync, raw fallback
- signal handler: code+addr, O_SYNC fd
- uncaught exception: sync write + fsync both fds
- watchdog: dumps main thread callStackSymbols (40 frames) on stuck
- ghost hook verbose: logs class/args/block flag every call
- lifecycle observers: memory warning + stack, terminate, background
- bump pack_ipa output to Potuzhno_v12_4_FULLLOG.ipa
---
 Tweak.m     | 230 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 pack_ipa.py |   2 +-
 2 files changed, 160 insertions(+), 72 deletions(-)

